# Start: the carousel on the system the suite line set with StartupSystem
# (a game list's first entry is the fixture game). End: the carousel.
#
# The SAVE STATE MANAGER for the list's first game: carousel, list, X for
# GAME OPTIONS, A for the manager, right to the capture tile, back out.
# Read the manager frames for the START NEW GAME arrow (one arrow, one
# direction, one size on every system -- #250) and the capture tile at the
# system's aspect (#243) and turn (#245, #248).
settle
shot 0-carousel
key x
wait-for-change
settle
shot 1-list
key s
wait-for-change 6
settle
shot 2-game-options
key x
wait-for-change 10
settle 10 2
shot 3-manager
key right
wait-for-change 4
settle
shot 4-manager-next-tile
key z
wait-for-change
settle
key z
wait-for-change
settle
dismiss-dialogs
